{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2023-05-24 12:20:00', 'title': 'COMERICA BANK AND KALAMAZOO GROWLERS PARTNER TO HOST 2ND ANNUAL FOOD DRIVE BENEFITTING SOUTH MICHIGAN FOOD BANK', 'text': 'COMMUNITY ENCOURAGED TO DONATE NONPERISHABLE FOOD IN EXCHANGE FOR BASEBALL TICKETS KALAMAZOO, MICH. , MAY 24, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FOR THE SECOND STRAIGHT YEAR, COMERICA BANK\xa0AND THE KALAMAZOO GROWLERS\xa0ARE PARTNERING TO HOST A SUMMER-LONG FOOD DRIVE BENEFITTING SOUTH MICHIGAN FOOD BANK\xa0FROM JUNE 2 THROUGH JULY 27.'}